-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; - </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">현재 부서별 세부모집사항 미확정으로, </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; - 확정 후 공지할 예정입니다.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">3. 근로장학생 선발일(예정)</span></strong> : 2019.2.25.(월)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">4. 근무기간</span></strong> : 2019.3.1.(금)~2019.6.23.(일) [학기 중]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></span></span></span></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">5. 국가근로장학생 자격 요건</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;2019-1학기</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;한국장학재단 국가 교육근로장학사업&nbsp;신청자 중 순위 통과자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; →&nbsp;3순위 이내(8분위 이하)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; →&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">신청기간 중에는 원스톱서비스 로그인→학생지원→근로장학생 신청서 제출에서도 확인 가능</span></span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span>정규학기 내 재학생 (휴학생, 초과학기자 제외)</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">직전학기 성적 70점/100점 만점(평점 1.6) 이상</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">국가근로 우선선발순위: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">“1순위(소득 4분위 이하)&gt; 2순위(5~6분위)&gt; 3순위(7~8분위)”</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><strong>6. 대학근로장학생 자격 요건</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">2019-1학기 재학생 중 직전학기 성적 70점/100점 만점(평점 1.6) 이상</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">정규학기 내 재학생 (휴학생, 초과학기자 제외)</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
